      "how_to_mix": [
        "Exactly one mood is active (target gain 1), the others fade to 0. Within the active mood, speed is additive: still = still stems; fast = still + fast stems; flying = still + fast + flying stems.",
        "Every stem has a role: 'bed' (everything pitched) or 'drums' (all percussion of that layer). The Dark modifier (docs/HELL-SHADOW.md section 3) multiplies every 'drums' stem by DarkHush.MusicDrums(depth), the 'drone' stem by DarkHush.MusicDrone(depth), and the music bus low-pass by DarkHush.MusicCutoff(depth).",
        "Stems are pre-levelled: with gain 1 on the right set, each of the 9 mood x speed combinations is at its intended loudness (listed in 'mix_lufs'). Do not normalise them.",
        "Mood changes: equal-power fades starting on a bar line. Into danger: 1 s at the next bar line. Out of danger: 3 s, only after the threat has stayed low for 2 bars. Quiet <-> normal: 2 s.",
        "Speed changes: the fast/flying stems fade in over 0.5 s at the next beat (not bar) and out over 1.5 s; smooth the player's speed over ~0.5 s with hysteresis so a single jump doesn't flicker it.",
        "Time Dilation: the plan is a low-pass + slight pitch drop on the whole music bus (the same muffle as the world), not a separate stem."
      ],
      "speed_thresholds_hint": {
        "fast_mps": 11,
        "flying_mps": 18,
        "note": "tune in play"
      },
      "mood_hint": "quiet = no enemy alerted and no objective pressure; normal = enemies alerted or an objective running; danger = health under 35% or an objective about to fail / last seconds of a clock; the boss uses its own cue.",
